# Cloudflare Pages redirects/rewrites.
# growth: real paths for the public pages. 200 = a rewrite (the address bar keeps /pricing, no redirect chain):
# index.html is served and the router in assets/app.js maps the last path segment back to the view (hashes keep
# working). functions/_middleware.js (these paths are in _routes.json) puts the page's own <title>, description,
# canonical and Open Graph tags into the HTML for crawlers and link previews. Listed in sitemap.xml.
